        <!-- Step 7: What you bring -->
        <div class="step" data-step="6">
          <p class="step-eyebrow">Section 05 · What You Bring</p>
          <h2 class="step-title">What do you bring to the room?</h2>
          <p class="step-hint">The best networks are two-way. What expertise, resources, services or opportunities could you offer other members?</p>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="whatYouBring">Your contribution *</label>
            <textarea id="whatYouBring" placeholder="Be specific. Not 'I'm good with people' — what can you actually offer or introduce?" rows="6"></textarea>
